    }
  },
  {
    "id": "sub10.example.org",
    "context_attributes": {
      "relationship_type": "subdomains"
    }
  }
]
```

> **Note:**  
> - The actual IDs (`subX.example.org`) will reflect the real subdomains VirusTotal has indexed for `example.org`.  
> - If there are fewer than 10 subdomains available, the array will contain only the existing ones.  
> - The `continuation_cursor` in the meta section (`defghijklmnop` in the example) can be used for subsequent pagination requests.  

Feel free to copy the request into your preferred HTTP client or script, replace the placeholder API key, and parse the JSON to extract the `id` and `context_attributes` fields as shown.
